Viktor 10.10.2026: «По моему набору семплеров хочу попросить, чтобы ты их внедрил… Семплеры: er_sde, res_*s, res_*s_ode, heun(pp2), exp_heun_2_x0(_sde). Планировщики: bong_tangent, sgm_uniform, exponential, beta, kl_optimal, beta57».

The sampler's choice: Euler, Euler SDE, ER-SDE, RES 2s and 3s with their ODE ones, Heun++ 2, Exp Heun 2 x0 and its SDE; the schedule's: Simple, Karras, Exponential, Beta, Beta 57, KL optimal, SGM uniform, Bong tangent; the summary names them; the time grows by the looks a step takes (two, three). Two warnings under the sampling, as the matrix of 30 pictures showed them: Lightning under Karras or Exponential paints the subject twice; without Lightning Euler SDE paints Qwen soft.

Suite: 604/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
